      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-05-01_WidnesExaminer_art0085" n="art0085">
        <head>BIRTHS. MARRIAGES. DEATHS.</head>
        <p>BIRTHS. MARRIAGES. DEATHS.</p>
        <p>Notices of births, marriages, and deaths, in memoriam notices, and acknowledgments of sympathy are inserted in" The Examiner" at the following rates:—.Not exceeding -20 words, is. 6d. each; every additional Ittven words, 6d.</p>
