        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, MAY 1, 1915.</p>
        <p>+0 e + + • +4. 44 •4. 40 414 + 41+ 41 4. 40 40 41 4* 41 4* 4* 4* 40 4* 4* 41 4* 40 4* 4. 4* 4* 4* +4*414*464*4*414*4*40 4* 4* 4* 4* 4. • +O+...:":"C":":":":.++++44++4":":":***++,4":":.+O+++*.:":":.+,.:.*4":'• 0•4•f43 4 40</p>
