        <p>• GOOD WORK IN THE CUP-TIES. . . t addltioti to their League games, (lo Warring- figured •in five clip matches. They did t'zeellently'in the Lancashire Cup. Competition, getting into the third round before they met the. ir masters. First they polished off Barrow to the tune of 10-0, and then the disposed of Nalford by 22-L-10, but the Rochdale Hornets ~...vod too much for them, and defeated them wilderspool—where indeed they were fortun- h 6 (4-Longh to be able to play all their cup-ties— 5, after a good sledge-hammer kind of ". In the first round of the Northern -th`rn Cup Competition Warrington were th:;lvit against Leeds, and this match afforded 'Rt.' 41 a glorious opportunity for wiping out the for .o:fiirg(l.)ifri tnh;ir most crushing defeat of the season, the Christmas holidays the York- had beaten them 35-0. The Wilders- ,' luds seized the opportunity afforded by the tioi and. managed to win by one point, the 'aa-l.e,S(:ading 5-4.. In the second round of the forrution Warrington were opposed to Sal- . ' wh d t vkto... 0 prove too strong, and ran out i!ous by 11 points to two.</p>
        <p>A RARE DISTINCTION. 4114, distinction belongs to Warrington, and 14khLS that they were one of the only two clubs ~,1111d the honour of beating Huddersfield in tiviirl? fixtures this sea-on. They accomplished 1)14372,4 the very opening match, which was at liuddersfield, and in which the score :Pitiat9-----12 in favour Of the Wilderspool corn- bl4 11°11. On the occasion of their. next meet- the' tuowever, Huddersfield completely turned fiwt.`table,s on them, winning on Warrington's a,llll by 26 points to ten. Both at home S'alto 'raY Warrington managed to defeat # Leigh, 'NI • IA and Runcorn, whilst they, lost bolt of -L'eagu fixture: with the Broughton allße ' rs, the Rochdale Hornets and Wigan. The (4-4:sji. were made 'with Leeds (3-3), Dewsbury .kitoalld Widnes (2-2). tou Other, including cup matches, Warring- ftleire.tted 11P 293 points during the season, and tlle"Yarious . opponents scored 370 against •</p>
