        <p>WEST LANCASHIRE TERRITORIALS. OUT OF TWELVE BATTALIONS of this DIVISION NINE ARE ALREADY AT THE FRONT, AND THE REMAINING THREE ARE UNDER ORDERS TO PROCEED THERE IMMEDIATELY. IT IS ESSENTIAL THAT THE RESERVE BATTALIONS SHALL BE KEPT UP TO FULL STRENGTH, and RECRUITS ARE URGENTLY REQUIRED. Do not let your Comrades at the Front reproach you for want of support. Recruits for the sth, 6th, 7th, and , 9th Battalions The King's (Liverpool Regiment) will be taken either at the Recruiting Depot, COOPER'S BUILDINGS, CHURCH-STREET, Liverpool, from 9 o'clock onwards each day, or at the Headquarters of these Battalions:- sth Battalion: ST. ANNE-ST.. LIVERPOOL. 6th Battalion:. UPPER WARWICK STREET, LIVERPOOL. 7th Battalion: PARK-STREET, BOOTLE. 9th Battalion: EVERTON-RD., LIVERPOOL. Recruits for the Bth and 10th Battalions will be taken at the Headquarters of these Units:- Bth Battalion: SHAW-STREET. LIVERPOOL. 10th Battalion: FRASER-ST., LIVERPOOL. DERBY, chairman, WEST LANCASHIRE ASSOCIATION.</p>
